msgstr "État"

msgid "Move it. Don't store it."
msgstr "Transférez, ne stockez pas."

msgid "Private connections between your own devices. Files go directly from one device to another, only after the receiving person approves, and no cloud folder is involved."
msgstr "Des connexions privées entre vos appareils. Les fichiers passent directement d’un appareil à l’autre, uniquement après l’accord du destinataire, sans dossier cloud."

